            "sid": "REV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido abu kaany kotoma aitapoet kana ibalasin, ka ŋul da luebwanenito kwana ta: konapito iboro lukatorob bala luka akim, ka luka ebululu, ka luka acukuman; koputosi akwes nuka ibalasin bala akwes nuka iŋatunyo, kolom akim ka apuru ka acukuman kaitukekec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu aiticaneta nu auni nualomunete kaitukekec koarata atutubet nakiwuniet naka ituŋa, kes akim, ka apuru, ka acukuman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai ejai apedor naka ibalasin toma aitukekec, ido toma okoriokec; naarai eputosi ikoriokec bala imunwo, ejaas akwes, nuisiriebiata,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
